# Judge5-7-1

; BGM変更：AccUhEarts(Vocal無)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Angry2,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我什么<br>都没做……！<br>艾玛小姐的推理<br>太离谱了……<br>说不定<br>艾玛小姐<br>是被谁操控了……！|#0105Trial07_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:才没有操控……！<br>我只是逐一验证了<br>发生过的事，<br>然后把它们<br>串联起来<br>而已……！|#0105Trial07_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……不过，<br>梅露露说的<br>确实有一定道理。<br><br>|#0105Trial07_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就算奈叶香<br>真的有办法穿过<br>地下设施的墙壁，<br>或者<br>艾玛提出的情报<br>都是真实的……|#0105Trial07_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但……我们没有<br>任何一件<br>直接<link=\"Objection_01_05_07_01\">证据</link><br>表明梅露露<br>杀害了奈叶香，<br>不是吗？|#0105Trial07_Margo003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我认为，<br>不管是奈叶香嘴里<br>留下的<link=\"Objection_01_05_07_02\">伤口</link>，<br>还是<link=\"Objection_01_05_07_03\">子弹</link>，<br>作为<link=\"Objection_01_05_07_04\">证明梅露露作案的证据</link><br>都缺乏决定性。|#0105Trial07_Margo004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……我觉得<br>艾玛亲说的<br>还是很有道理的。<br>|#0105Trial07_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL3,Eyes2_Surprised_Open1,Mouth2_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:怎、怎么会……！<br>连可可小姐也……！|#0105Trial07_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR8,ArmL9,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不是……！<br>但是……！<br>要说有没有<br>完全相信……<br>我还是更倾向于<br>觉得艾玛亲<br>在妄想……！|#0105Trial07_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR8,ArmL9,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……小梅真的<br>会做坏事吗……<br>我有点不确定……|#0105Trial07_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


